Feature Request for Instagram
Feature Request

App:Instagram

Feature Name: Scheduled Story Posting

As a Product Manager, I would introduce a Scheduled Story Posting feature. Users can create a Story and choose a future date and time for 
it to be posted automatically. This would be useful for students, creators and businesses who want to post at the right time without 
opening the app later.

Why this feature is useful:

=>Saves time by scheduling Stories in advance.

=>Helps creators maintain a regular posting schedule.

=>Allows businesses to post promotional content at the best time.

Team Members Involved

Team Member                  What they would do

Product Manager          =>  Defines the feature, collects user feedback, and coordinates the team.

UI/UX Designer           =>  Designs the schedule button, date & time picker, and confirmation screen.

Backend/API Developer    =>  Builds the server logic to save scheduled Stories and publish them automatically at the selected time.

Mobile Developer         =>  Implements the feature in the Instagram app and connects it with backend APIs.

Tester (QA)              =>  Tests scheduling, automatic posting, notifications, and fixes bugs before release.
